# Nested AGENTS.md

- Every meaningful code/docs folder must have an `AGENTS.md` (Role + Contents + Boundaries).
- When working in a subtree, read the nearest `AGENTS.md` before editing.
- When creating a new folder, add `AGENTS.md` in the same change.
- Keep leaf overviews short; put the child map on the parent.
- Full convention and top-level map: root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
- Skip only `node_modules`, `.next`, `.git`.
